# NOTE: backend/api/[...path].js (the Vercel function bundle) is intentionally
# COMMITTED — Vercel validates api/ functions and the vercel.json `functions`
# patterns BEFORE the build command runs, so the catch-all must exist in the
# repo. npm run vercel-build regenerates it deterministically on every deploy.

